---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - AI Free Calculator"
  description="Read our transparent Privacy Policy. Learn how AI Free Calculator protects your privacy, handles client-side computations, cookies, and advertising partners."
>
  <!-- Hero Header -->
  <div class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 via-white to-slate-50 px-4 py-16 dark:border-slate-800 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-slate-950 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50/80 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 dark:border-blue-900/60 dark:bg-blue-950/50 dark:text-blue-300 shadow-xs">
        <span>🔒</span> Privacy &amp; Data Transparency
      </div>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        We believe your numbers are your business. Understand exactly what data is processed, how our client-side tools protect you, and how our advertising partners operate.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        <span class="rounded-lg bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 dark:bg-slate-800">
          📅 Effective Date: September 2026
        </span>
        <span class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 px-3 py-1 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 dark:text-emerald-300">
          ✓ 100% Client-Side Private Processing
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Body -->
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:py-16 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
    
    <!-- Quick Key Summary Card -->
    <div class="mb-12 rounded-3xl border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/50 p-6 dark:border-blue-900/40 dark:bg-blue-950/20 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>💡</span> Key Highlights at a Glance
      </h2>
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>
          <span><strong>Zero Calculation Storage:</strong> Values you type (salary, loan amount, weight, dimensions) run purely in your local browser and are never saved or sent to any database.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>
          <span><strong>No Account Needed:</strong> You don't need to register, provide an email, or log in to use our 42+ calculators.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold">ℹ️</span>
          <span><strong>Standard Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics (GA4) with IP anonymization to evaluate aggregate traffic trends and improve tools.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold">ℹ️</span>
          <span><strong>Ad Networks:</strong> We display ads via Google AdSense and authorized partners to keep all calculator utilities completely free.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-xs text-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">1</span>
          Introduction
        </h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>AI Free Calculator</strong> (<a href="https://aifreecalculator.com" class="text-blue-600 underline dark:text-blue-400">aifreecalculator.com</a>). This Privacy Policy explains our practices regarding the collection, usage, protection, and disclosure of information when you access our calculation tools, web utilities, and services.
        </p>
        <p>
          By using AI Free Calculator, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy. If you disagree with any part of this policy, you may discontinue use of the website at any time.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-xs text-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">2</span>
          Calculation Inputs &amp; User Data Privacy (Client-Side Architecture)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Unlike conventional cloud software that stores user inputs on remote servers, <strong>AI Free Calculator executes mathematical formulas directly inside your web browser (client-side via JavaScript)</strong>.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Financial Calculations:</strong> Your income, tax brackets, loan amounts, monthly EMI numbers, interest rates, and SIP investments remain exclusively on your device.</li>
          <li><strong>Civil &amp; Construction Data:</strong> Dimensions, concrete mix ratios, steel weights, brick counts, and BOQ estimates are calculated locally in your browser memory.</li>
          <li><strong>Health &amp; Fitness Metrics:</strong> Body weight, height, age, BMI calculations, BMR rates, and calorie targets are not transmitted or logged.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/60 p-4 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-900 dark:border-emerald-900/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/30 dark:text-emerald-200">
          🛡️ Summary: We do not log, sell, transmit, or retain your individual calculator numerical inputs on our servers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-xs text-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">3</span>
          Information We Automatically Collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          When you browse our website, our hosting provider (such as Cloudflare) and analytics services may automatically collect standard non-personally identifiable technical data, including:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Browser type, language preference, and operating system version.</li>
          <li>Approximate geographical location (country/city level, without precise GPS).</li>
          <li>Referring website URL and exit pages.</li>
          <li>Page visit timestamps, calculation tool interactions, and error diagnostic logs.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-xs text-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">4</span>
          Cookies, Local Storage &amp; Web Analytics
        </h2>
        <p>
          We use cookies and browser local storage for the following essential and analytical functions:
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 mt-2">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Theme &amp; UI Preference</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Stores your chosen Dark / Light mode preference locally in <code>localStorage</code> so you don't have to re-select it on every page.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Google Analytics (GA4)</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Collects anonymous aggregated metrics (e.g. which calculators are visited most) to help us optimize server performance and prioritize new tools.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          You can disable or delete cookies at any time through your individual web browser settings. Disabling cookies will not affect the core functionality of any calculator.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-xs text-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">5</span>
          Advertising Partners &amp; Google AdSense
        </h2>
        <p>
          We display advertisements supplied by Google AdSense, Google Ad Manager (AdX), and authorized partner networks to cover server infrastructure and maintain free access for all visitors.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Google DoubleClick / DART Cookies:</strong> Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to our site and other websites across the Internet.</li>
          <li><strong>Personalized vs. Non-Personalized Ads:</strong> Depending on your jurisdiction and browser privacy settings, ads may be tailored based on generalized interests.</li>
          <li><strong>Opt-Out of Personalized Ads:</strong> You can manage or disable Google personalized advertising by visiting the <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline dark:text-blue-400">Google Ads Settings</a> page or the <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline dark:text-blue-400">Digital Advertising Alliance Consumer Choice tool</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-xs text-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">6</span>
          GDPR (European Economic Area) &amp; CCPA/CPRA Privacy Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your location, you hold specific statutory data protection rights:
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Your Privacy Entitlements:</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
            <li><strong>Right to Know / Access:</strong> Request confirmation of whether any personal information is retained.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Erasure / Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of any personal communications sent to us.</li>
            <li><strong>Do Not Sell My Information:</strong> We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data.</li>
            <li><strong>Non-Discrimination:</strong> Equal access and identical calculator functionality regardless of privacy selections.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-xs text-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">7</span>
          Children’s Privacy Protection (COPPA Compliance)
        </h2>
        <p>
          AI Free Calculator does not knowingly solicit or collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If you believe that a child has provided us with personal contact data, please notify us immediately, and we will promptly remove such records from our logs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-xs text-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">8</span>
          Updates to This Privacy Policy
        </h2>
        <p>
          We may update our Privacy Policy periodically to reflect new features, regulations, or privacy technologies. Any updates will be published directly on this page with a revised effective date at the top.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <section class="space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>📬</span> Contacting Us About Privacy
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          If you have questions, feedback, or inquiries regarding our privacy standards, please reach out via our dedicated <a href="/contact/" class="text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline dark:text-blue-400">Contact Us form</a> or email our webmaster at <code class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">support@aifreecalculator.com</code>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
